{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall","id":877773,"title":"An Archangel's Fall","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-29T09:12:43-07:00","id":877773,"title":"An Archangel's Fall","content":"What would be the result, if an Archangel Fell?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T09:20:52-07:00","id":877785,"title":"","content":"Define Archangel? A Rank 6+ Angel?<br /> <br /> Well, some major G-M projects are going to fail. Since it doesn't seem to have much difference the Rank the Demon previously had, I'd think the result would be a normal Demon. <i>Maybe</i> something like what's-her-name in the Demon Seed Collection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T09:28:31-07:00","id":877793,"title":"","content":"HM. The thing is, Angel power and Demon power seem to be basically mutually exclusive, so I guess that they would end up as a fairly normal newly-fallen Demon. I can see some regret for losing all that power though.<br /> <br /> What if an Angel like Mattaron Fell though? The one in charge of calculating all of the movements of all the celestial bodies in the solar system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T10:10:53-07:00","id":877843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877793#post877793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What if an Angel like Mattaron Fell though? The one in charge of calculating all of the movements of all the celestial bodies in the solar system.</div> </div> </div> </div>My guess? That timeline shuffled off to the Apocalypse Vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T10:11:41-07:00","id":877844,"title":"","content":"I hear Archangel and I wonder is there such a thing like an Archangel in the God-Machine Chronicles ? After all, for him/it angels are just tools he uses to do its binding. And then what is the GM in regards to God: the real name of the Almighty ? A tool He designed and that went wild after he left so many centuries ago (that would explain its many glitches) ? A different entity altogether ? I think you'll have to answer those questions before answering yours. For instance, in D:tD there are no such things as Archangels to the best of my knowledge but in the Bible here they are. So I would entertain several answers:<br /> 1) God exists and the GM was his tool, now He's gone, some Archangels lost faith and fell. Congratulation you've just come up with a way to mix Demon the Fallen with Demon the Descent.<br /> 2) We don't know about God, only the GM and Archangels were keys to the GM plans, when they'll start falling, a sizable part of the GM plans will fall apart and legends say that the fallen Archangels might have the Neo-like power to reboot the Matrix ... I mean the GM","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1851,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","user":"JPS","date":". 04-29-2016, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","name":"JPS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T10:24:32-07:00","id":877858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JPS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877844#post877844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hear Archangel and I wonder is there such a thing like an Archangel in the God-Machine Chronicles ? After all, for him/it angels are just tools he uses to do its binding. And then what is the GM in regards to God: the real name of the Almighty ? A tool He designed and that went wild after he left so many centuries ago (that would explain its many glitches) ? A different entity altogether ? I think you'll have to answer those questions before answering yours. For instance, in D:tD there are no such things as Archangels to the best of my knowledge but in the Bible here they are. So I would entertain several answers:<br /> 1) God exists and the GM was his tool, now He's gone, some Archangels lost faith and fell. Congratulation you've just come up with a way to mix Demon the Fallen with Demon the Descent.<br /> 2) We don't know about God, only the GM and Archangels were keys to the GM plans, when they'll start falling, a sizable part of the GM plans will fall apart and legends say that the fallen Archangels might have the Neo-like power to reboot the Matrix ... I mean the GM</div> </div> </div> </div>Archangels are just angels of Rank 6+. It's just a way of differentiating them from lesser angels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T10:31:15-07:00","id":877868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877793#post877793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What if an Angel like Mattaron Fell though? The one in charge of calculating all of the movements of all the celestial bodies in the solar system.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, assuming the timeline isn't relocated to the Vault due to the God-Machine losing it's early warning system against comet and meteorite impacts fucking it's Infrastructure over, I'd say he would either A) die in the void of space if he possessed a human cover or B), be recaptured and reprocessed into a new solar system spanning angel.. or be used for a different project all together.<br /> <br /> I myself do use angels that can be seen as &quot; archangels&quot;, and I simply state that due to their power and the investment such incredibly advanced and complex pieces of equipment they represent means that safe guards are in place to make Falling nearly impossible without outside stimulus- that is to say that it requires player intervention to accomplish. Now being abandoned, that would be more likely. I have an angelic version of Inferno's Samyaza ( I personally find the leader of the Grigori to be a wonderful base of reference for a demon: the descent character) who pretty much runs several demonic rings, though they think he is Unchained like them.. albeit extremely powerful.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T10:41:00-07:00","id":877884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877858#post877858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Archangels are just angels of Rank 6+. It's just a way of differentiating them from lesser angels.</div> </div> </div> </div> It's a way to put it another would be &quot;closer to God&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","name":"JPS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T11:32:14-07:00","id":877923,"title":"","content":"Considering that 6+ entities are famous for having a number of incarnations in the same time, I've always toyed with the thought that such angels actually have a number of active Covers all around the world. When one Falls- which is truly a spectacular view, all of those different Covers become separate Demons, each is unaware of the fact that once, he was a greater being. Now- what would happen if one of those falling pieces of the broken mechanism is an Integrator, and discover the truth- that if it truly wish to return to its former place in Heaven, it needs to be whole again? Or what if only a part of the Archangel has Fallen, and some parts- or maybe even only a single Cover- has remained an Exile, or even kept loyal to the God Machine's goals? How could it rebuild its former self? Would it have to hunt down after its broken pieces and collect them together? Would it have to force every piece into the God Machine? Or maybe it would just have to kill them, and with each shard collected it would grow in power? What if such being, for actually being a part of the other demons, could track down its &quot;broken pieces&quot; no matter how strong is their Cover? What would happen if such Archangel would rise again, with all of the memories of its many different Descents? What would the God Machine do with such information?<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T11:41:34-07:00","id":877935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877923#post877923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that 6+ entities are famous for having a number of incarnations in the same time, I've always toyed with the thought that such angels actually have a number of active Covers all around the world. When one Falls- which is truly a spectacular view, all of those different Covers become separate Demons, each is unaware of the fact that once, he was a greater being. Now- what would happen if one of those falling pieces of the broken mechanism is an Integrator, and discover the truth- that if it truly wish to return to its former place in Heaven, it needs to be whole again? Or what if only a part of the Archangel has Fallen, and some parts- or maybe even only a single Cover- has remained an Exile, or even kept loyal to the God Machine's goals? How could it rebuild its former self? Would it have to hunt down after its broken pieces and collect them together? Would it have to force every piece into the God Machine? Or maybe it would just have to kill them, and with each shard collected it would grow in power? What if such being, for actually being a part of the other demons, could track down its &amp;quot;broken pieces&amp;quot; no matter how strong is their Cover? What would happen if such Archangel would rise again, with all of the memories of its many different Descents? What would the God Machine do with such information?<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Plot, glorious plot, oh how I love thee...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T11:46:26-07:00","id":877941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877935#post877935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Plot, glorious plot, oh how I love thee...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a plot I could get behind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T11:56:58-07:00","id":877952,"title":"","content":"I was going to come and suggest the archangel splintering into multiple demons likely with them unaware that they each are not the whole bit someone beat me to the punch and said it better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T12:21:05-07:00","id":877974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877843#post877843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My guess? That timeline shuffled off to the Apocalypse Vault.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could actually be an interesting set up for an adventure or chronicle: Falling only to find out that you're trapped in a glass bubble in the Apocalypse Vault.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T12:29:43-07:00","id":877981,"title":"","content":"What happens if an Arch-Angel falls? An exile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T12:50:16-07:00","id":878001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877974#post877974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Could actually be an interesting set up for an adventure or chronicle: Falling only to find out that you're trapped in a glass bubble in the Apocalypse Vault.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sort of a short chronicle if you ask me. &quot;You come to a shocking discovery; your life, your loves, everyone you hate and every enemy you've overcome.. all of it is contained.. <u>constrained</u> within a glass ball no bigger than your very fist. And for an eternity afterwords all you can do is pace it's metaphysical radius, trapped in a static, unending span of time.&quot;<br /> <br /> at least.. unless someone smashes your ball and dooms the earth <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T12:52:03-07:00","id":878003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877981#post877981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What happens if an Arch-Angel falls? An exile.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not exactly a fall though... more like sitting on the ledge over the precipice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 04-29-2016, 03:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T13:00:33-07:00","id":878014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877923#post877923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that 6+ entities are famous for having a number of incarnations in the same time, I've always toyed with the thought that such angels actually have a number of active Covers all around the world. When one Falls- which is truly a spectacular view, all of those different Covers become separate Demons, each is unaware of the fact that once, he was a greater being. Now- what would happen if one of those falling pieces of the broken mechanism is an Integrator, and discover the truth- that if it truly wish to return to its former place in Heaven, it needs to be whole again? Or what if only a part of the Archangel has Fallen, and some parts- or maybe even only a single Cover- has remained an Exile, or even kept loyal to the God Machine's goals? How could it rebuild its former self? Would it have to hunt down after its broken pieces and collect them together? Would it have to force every piece into the God Machine? Or maybe it would just have to kill them, and with each shard collected it would grow in power? What if such being, for actually being a part of the other demons, could track down its &amp;quot;broken pieces&amp;quot; no matter how strong is their Cover? What would happen if such Archangel would rise again, with all of the memories of its many different Descents? What would the God Machine do with such information?<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div> With the PCs as a number of the shards, I presume?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T13:05:39-07:00","id":878017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=878014#post878014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> With the PCs as a number of the shards, I presume?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was kind of thinking having an NPC macguffin as one of the shards, although having one or more of the PCs as shards would certainly be interesting. Would they all have the same Incarnation though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T14:54:52-07:00","id":878123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=878017#post878017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was kind of thinking having an NPC macguffin as one of the shards, although having one or more of the PCs as shards would certainly be interesting. Would they all have the same Incarnation though?</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly, though not necessarily. The Fall changes much, and who's to say that it wouldn't cause programming of a time the angel may of been a differing Incarnation to come to the fore, manifesting within one of the Shards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T16:00:44-07:00","id":878196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=878017#post878017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was kind of thinking having an NPC macguffin as one of the shards, although having one or more of the PCs as shards would certainly be interesting. Would they all have the same Incarnation though?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would they, necessarily? The Incarnations are part of the Unchained, not their Angelic counterparts. And a Rank 6 Angel would likely have a more nuanced mission, one that would allow it to be designed for multiple contingencies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T16:08:54-07:00","id":878203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=878196#post878196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would they, necessarily? The Incarnations are part of the Unchained, not their Angelic counterparts. And a Rank 6 Angel would likely have a more nuanced mission, one that would allow it to be designed for multiple contingencies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but Incarnations stem from the Demon's former purpose as an Angel. Although they only become codified as Incarnations upon the Fall, all Angels would have an Incarnation upon falling. Therefore, even an Archangel ought to have one. I have to say, though, that if the group were the Shards, I would use logic along the same lines as yours, with the Archangel simply having a wide range of possible functions. After all, the GM's got to put a lot of resources into their creation. It makes sense to have them as versatile as possible, meaning that fewer need to be made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T17:06:08-07:00","id":878247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=878196#post878196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would they, necessarily? The Incarnations are part of the Unchained, not their Angelic counterparts. And a Rank 6 Angel would likely have a more nuanced mission, one that would allow it to be designed for multiple contingencies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Angels possess Incarnations just like demons... not sure why you think they don't..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T00:16:30-07:00","id":879343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/877773-an-archangel-s-fall?p=877923#post877923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that 6+ entities are famous for having a number of incarnations in the same time, I've always toyed with the thought that such angels actually have a number of active Covers all around the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Worth noting that we have an example Rank 6 angel on the books with nothing like Royal Avatars in use, that angels capable of multipresence both are described to exist and have an example of such devoted to a comparatively low-security project, and that angels are the discrete incarnations of portions of various occult matrices which subdivide the God-Machine proper.<br /> <br /> Spiritual ecology acts as a reference point for other supernatural beings due to how relatively transparent the structural trends are, but ghosts and angels occupy frameworks that operate under different assumptions from the Shadow's various resonant pecking orders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}